      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "aa95dee7e905",
      "_type": "richText",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "74743df2aff1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "2. Infrastructure Consolidation"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "db5c8aba51d6",
      "_type": "richText",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4361e1332e6f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "After the audit, we planned a leaner setup that would reduce recurring spend without affecting the client\u2019s live systems."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "057862d90905",
      "_type": "richText",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c853122359a4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The DigitalOcean compute layer was reviewed and replaced with a more cost-effective hosting structure where suitable. The goal was not just to move servers, but to simplify operations and reduce unnecessary compute cost."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "63adc698280f",
      "_type": "richText",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f42afa64e361",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "3. Docker and Coolify Implementation"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
