  "resultsSummary": "The client\u2019s cloud bill was not high because the business had outgrown its infrastructure. It was high because years of unmanaged cloud usage had created silent waste. Servers were overprovisioned, storage was not lifecycle-managed, deployments were difficult to maintain, and the infrastructure had no clear cost-control process.\n\nKP Infotech reviewed the complete setup, identified unnecessary spend, migrated workloads into a leaner environment, introduced Docker-based deployment management with Coolify, and optimized AWS S3 storage using lifecycle policies and intelligent tiering.\n\nThe result was a major reduction in recurring cloud cost, better infrastructure control, easier deployments, and a setup the client could maintain and scale with more confidence.",
